# .piiignore — repo-owned PII-scan exclusions (TrueNorth pii-scan, dagger-checks
# v1.1.2+). One path or glob per line, relative to the repo root, '#' comments.
#
# API.md is upstream's generated JSON-RPC API reference: every example carries
# millisecond epoch timestamps (1711665303229, 1746147705443, …) which
# Presidio's CREDIT_CARD recognizer scores 1.0 (Luhn-plausible 13-digit runs).
# They are timestamps, not card numbers — 8 strict false positives measured on
# the first full-tree scan (run 42936588470, 2026-11-11). Excluded as a whole
# file; nothing else is. Do NOT add real PII here — rotate it instead.
API.md
